      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Game Name is a one-button action game where you, a mystical warrior, must
    defeat powerful guardians by automatically shooting arrows while strategically
    controlling your movement. As you grow stronger, your victories bring prosperity
    to your land and village, with the flourishing of the village tied to your success.
    Each difficulty level you choose rewards you with gold, which can be spent in
    the shop to purchase power-ups and enhance your abilities. The challenge lies
    in mastering the single button, which offers multiple functions depending on
    whether you tap, hold, or slide it.\n\n\r\nGame Platforms\r\nMobile Gaming\r\n\r\nAge
    Rating\r\n\u2014\r\n\r\nProduction Team\r\n8:1 Productions\r\n\r\nDEVELOPER TEAM:\r\n\r\nProduct
    Owner\r\nRonald Villarde\r\n\r\nScrum Master\r\n John Kurt Caampued\r\n\r\nConcept
    Artist\r\nNathaniel Pangilinan\r\nSamantha Sacupon\r\n\r\nSFX Designer\r\nMarvin
    Cyrill Palomar\r\nRose Jean Besinga\r\n\r\nEditor\r\nCarl Jonas Dela Cruz\r\nNathaniel
    Pangilinan\r\n\r\nDocumentation\r\nShamantha Mae Fuentes\r\nRose Jean Besinga
    \r\nAlyssa Mackay\r\n\r\nScript Writer\r\nShamantha Mae Fuentes\r\n"
